WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.447
Welcome to AI Product Lab.

00:00:02.447 --> 00:00:08.414
This walkthrough uses simulated data and two local, rule-based prototypes.

00:00:09.714 --> 00:00:11.736
Open Feedback Studio.

00:00:11.736 --> 00:00:13.758
No sign-in is needed.

00:00:13.758 --> 00:00:17.706
Add one anonymous feedback item per line.

00:00:19.006 --> 00:00:25.150
Load the example, paste your own feedback, or import a text or CSV file.

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:32.624
After organizing, review each theme alongside its source IDs and original wording.

00:00:32.624 --> 00:00:35.786
A summary does not replace human judgment.

00:00:37.086 --> 00:00:42.641
Edit the proposed need and action, set a priority, and explain your reasoning.

00:00:42.641 --> 00:00:45.846
Mark the item as reviewed when you are ready.

00:00:47.146 --> 00:00:51.391
Export a Markdown brief or JSON file for team review.

00:00:51.391 --> 00:00:54.514
Save your work before leaving the page.

00:00:55.814 --> 00:00:57.697
Next, open Visit Notes.

00:00:57.697 --> 00:01:03.590
Add one fact per line, including when it happened and what you observed.

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:08.581
Check the fact timeline and missing details.

00:01:08.581 --> 00:01:11.853
Missing information does not mean none.

00:01:11.853 --> 00:01:14.202
This tool does not diagnose.

00:01:15.502 --> 00:01:18.875
Add corrections and confirm the facts yourself.

00:01:18.875 --> 00:01:22.750
Then export the notes to prepare for your appointment.

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:28.129
Choose the interface and output languages separately.

00:01:28.129 --> 00:01:30.746
Original source text is preserved.

00:01:32.046 --> 00:01:34.007
Now try your own example.

00:01:34.007 --> 00:01:39.654
This is an interactive prototype, with no live language model connected.
